# `avg` of numbers is `real`; of timespans a timespan truncated to whole µs; nulls ignored.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/reordered/*.csv'
| summarize a = avg(score), b = avg(id), t = avg(id * 1s / 3);
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where customerId == 'c-011'
| summarize a = avg(amount), n = count()
---- expected
a    | b    | t
real | real | timespan
-----+------+----------------
45.0 |  4.5 | 00:00:01.499999

a       | n
real    | long
--------+-----
33.0625 |    5
